sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Epoch/commit authority
  participant C as Coordinator
  participant R0 as Rank 0
  participant R1 as Rank 1
  participant S as Blob store

  C->>A: acquire epoch E / fencing token
  A-->>C: revision V
  C->>R0: Begin(E, seq, op, fp, target)
  C->>R1: Begin(E, seq, op, fp, target)
  par durable snapshot
    R0->>R0: publish immutable pages + rank manifest
    R1->>R1: publish immutable pages + rank manifest
  end
  opt HOST_FAILURE_DURABLE
    R0->>S: put-if-absent missing objects
    R1->>S: put-if-absent missing objects
  end
  R0-->>C: Prepared(rank0 manifest, target, proof)
  R1-->>C: Prepared(rank1 manifest, target, proof)
  C->>C: validate exact ranks, target, fp, epoch, durability
  C->>S: put-if-absent global manifest
  C->>A: CAS terminal OPEN/PARTIAL -> COMMITTED
  A-->>C: certificate + revision V+1
  C-->>R0: CommitNotice
  C-->>R1: CommitNotice
